@startuml US074_SSD

title US074 - Deactivate a Flight Route (System Sequence Diagram)

actor "Air Transport Company\nCollaborator" as ATCC
participant ":System" as System

activate ATCC
activate System
ATCC -> System : requests to deactivate a flight route
System --> ATCC : shows list of active routes for company

ATCC -> System : selects route code and deactivation date
System --> ATCC : shows summary for confirmation

ATCC -> System : confirms deactivation
System --> ATCC : confirms route deactivated successfully

@enduml